CHAPTER.VERS:
Hear this, O you

          {+}
         priests, and listen, O house of Israel, and give ear, O house of the king; for to you

          {+}
         pertains the judgment; for you

          {+}
         have been a snare at Mizpah, and a net spread on Tabor.

Blow

          {+}
         the cornet in Gibeah, and the trumpet in Ramah: sound an alarm at Beth-aven; behind you, O Benjamin.

When Ephraim saw his sickness, and Judah [saw] his wound, then Ephraim went to Assyria, and sent to the great king: but he is not able to heal you

          {+}
        , neither will he cure you

          {+}
         of your

          {+}
         wound.
